#. module: social_help
#: model:ir.module.module,name:social_help.module_meta_information
msgid "Social Help & Community Charter"
msgstr "Aide & charte communautaire"

#. module: social_help
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:social_help.module_meta_information
msgid "Public /community/help page with configurable charter"
msgstr "Page publique /community/help avec une charte configurable"

#. module: social_help
#: code:addons/social_help/controllers/portal.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "this community"
msgstr "cette communauté"

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid "Community help and charter"
msgstr "Aide communautaire et charte"

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid "Help & charter —"
msgstr "Aide & charte —"

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Three short answers to get you publishing,\n"
"                        moderating yourself, and contributing to a\n"
"                        healthy community feed."
msgstr ""
"Trois courtes réponses pour vous aider à publier,\n"
"                        à vous modérer vous-même et à contribuer à\n"
"                        un fil communautaire sain."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid "How do I post?"
msgstr "Comment publier?"

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Open the group you want to post in\n"
"                                            (find it from\n"
"                                            <a href=\"/groups\">/groups</a>) and\n"
"                                            join it if you aren't a member yet."
msgstr ""
"Ouvrez le groupe dans lequel vous voulez publier\n"
"                                            (depuis\n"
"                                            <a href=\"/groups\">/groups</a>) et\n"
"                                            rejoignez-le si vous n'en êtes pas encore membre."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Use the post form to share a short\n"
"                                            message. Pick a category that\n"
"                                            describes the intent so others can\n"
"                                            filter their feed."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez le formulaire pour partager un court\n"
"                                            message. Choisissez une catégorie qui\n"
"                                            décrit votre intention pour que les autres\n"
"                                            puissent filtrer leur fil."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Keep it concise and concrete.\n"
"                                            Date, place and contact in plain\n"
"                                            text always beat screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Restez concis et concret.\n"
"                                            La date, le lieu et le contact en clair\n"
"                                            valent toujours mieux qu'une capture d'écran."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Each group has its own rules\n"
"                                            displayed at the bottom of its\n"
"                                            page — read them once before\n"
"                                            posting."
msgstr ""
"Chaque groupe a ses propres règles\n"
"                                            affichées au bas de sa\n"
"                                            page — lisez-les une fois avant\n"
"                                            de publier."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid "How do I report a problematic post?"
msgstr "Comment signaler une publication problématique?"

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"On any post you find inappropriate,\n"
"                                            use the “Report” menu — moderators\n"
"                                            are notified right away."
msgstr ""
"Sur toute publication que vous jugez inappropriée,\n"
"                                            utilisez le menu « Signaler » — les modérateurs\n"
"                                            sont notifiés immédiatement."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Reports stay anonymous. The author\n"
"                                            doesn't see who reported them."
msgstr ""
"Les signalements restent anonymes. L'auteure ou l'auteur\n"
"                                            ne voit pas qui a signalé."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Don't pile on in the comments —\n"
"                                            one quiet report is more effective\n"
"                                            than ten angry replies."
msgstr ""
"N'en rajoutez pas dans les commentaires —\n"
"                                            un signalement discret est plus efficace\n"
"                                            que dix réponses enflammées."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid ""
"Real emergencies (fire, medical,\n"
"                                            crime in progress) go to 9-1-1.\n"
"                                            This network is not monitored\n"
"                                            24/7."
msgstr ""
"Les vraies urgences (incendie, médicales,\n"
"                                            crime en cours) passent par le 9-1-1.\n"
"                                            Ce réseau n'est pas surveillé\n"
"                                            24h/24."

#. module: social_help
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:social_help.community_help_page
msgid "Community charter"
msgstr "Charte communautaire"
